Industrial production equipment-deferral. 25LSO-0044, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
The fiscal impact, in the form of decreased property tax revenues, is
indeterminable.
According to the Department of Revenue, the value of equipment stored in Wyoming
currently or in the future cannot be determined. Companies typically do not
report whether equipment is installed or being held for future installation.
